# Only web/ is deployed here (see vercel.json). api/ has its own uv-managed Python
# dependencies, a long-running worker process, and needs real Postgres/Redis -- none of
# which exist in this build. Without this, Vercel's zero-config detection auto-builds api/
# as serverless functions anyway (found live, 2026-10-01: a ~300MB bundle each build,
# flirting with Vercel's size limit, for functions with no DB/Redis/env wired to them and
# no caller). api/ needs separate hosting; see docs/DECISIONS.md and vercel.json's commit.
api/
mock-data/
docs/
contracts/
scripts/
*.md
